# LLM instruction dataset: generated programs, validation results and the dataset are rebuilt
# by scripts/llm. Committed: capability.json and rates.json (they need a simulator run) and
# system_prompt.txt (the prompt the model is trained and served under -- a change to it invalidates
# a fine-tuned adapter, so it should show up in a diff).
data/llm/*.jsonl
